on drop:
	wait 1 second
	if name of event-item is "&a&kLORELORELORELORE":
		if block at location of event-dropped item is water:
			kill event-dropped item
			execute the command "/kit lorebook %event-player%"

on rightclick holding an eye of ender:
	if the player's tool is named "&4Eye of Sovereignty&r":
		cancel event
